# Line coverage floor (root V10, paradigm/V25): a ratchet read by `sherd
# coverage --check`. It may only rise, and only `sherd coverage --record`
# moves it. Lowering it is a reviewed commit that says why here.
#
# Set 2026-10-18 by `sherd coverage --record` (root T6): 87.67%, 995 of
# 1,135 lines under Sources/ (sherd counts Sources/ only, sherd PR 140).
# No exclusions yet: the Secure Enclave and terminal code root V10 exempts
# (CryptoKitCrypto, StandardIOStream, CLI.main) waits for the owner's
# exclusion convention (sherd#138), so it counts as uncovered here.
#
# Raised 2026-10-18 by `sherd coverage --record` in the wave 1 reconcile
# (root T17, paradigm/V18): 88.57%, 1,015 of 1,146 lines under Sources/.
# B1's fix (root T11, PR #6) and its tests added the gain.
#
# Raised 2026-10-18 by `sherd coverage --record` (root T20, before any
# refactor): 92.96%, 1,070 of 1,151 lines under Sources/. main stood at
# 88.62%, 1,020 of 1,151, after T9 (PR #11). Tests/CoverageTests.swift
# added the 50 lines, with no Sources/ change. The 81 still unrun: 42
# need a refactor (CLI.main's dispatch, the unreachable `assert(false)`
# in Options.parse, the SecAccessControl failure in generateKey) and 39
# need a Secure Enclave, macOS older than 26, a terminal or the process
# entry point.
#
# Raised 2026-10-18 by `sherd coverage --record` (root T28): 96.02%,
# 1,110 of 1,156 lines under Sources/. CLI.main now hands its dispatch to
# CLI.run, which CLIRunCoverageTests drive on DummyCrypto; the move added
# 5 lines. The 46 still unrun: 2 need a seam (the `assert(false)` and
# the SecAccessControl failure, one line each) and 44 need a Secure
# Enclave, macOS older than 26, a terminal or the process entry point
# (CLI.main's 9 lines and CLI.run's 2 default arguments among them).
#
# Raised 2026-10-18 by `sherd coverage --record` (root V10): 97.66%,
# 1,129 of 1,156 lines under Sources/. CLIProcessCoverageTests runs the
# built binary as a child, whose profile merges through the inherited
# LLVM_PROFILE_FILE: CLI.main (9), CLI.run's default stdin and print (2)
# and StandardIOStream (8) now run. No Sources/ change. The 27 still
# unrun: Crypto.swift 22 (Secure Enclave key create and load), HPKE.swift
# 2 (the macOS-older-than-26 guard), CLI.swift 2 (`default:` and its
# `assert(false)` in Options.parse; llvm-cov counts both lines) and
# Plugin.swift 1 (the SecAccessControl failure).
#
# Exclusions set 2026-10-18 (root T20, sherd PR 142): one `exclude` row
# per CryptoKitCrypto.newSecureEnclave* function, which creates or loads
# a real Secure Enclave key that no test host has (22 lines). A row is
# `exclude <path>:<declaration> <reason>`; sherd matches the declaration
# to the demangled (`--simplified`) symbol's last word. `excluded` caps
# the lines the rows remove; `--record` only lowers it. Adding a row or
# raising the cap is a reviewed hand edit that says why here. The floor
# was then recorded: 99.56%, 1,129 of 1,134 lines under Sources/.
# The 5 still unrun stay counted, not excluded: HPKE.swift 2 (the
# `#unavailable(macOS 26)` guard inside the otherwise covered
# HPKE.mlkemp256Encap; root T29 decides), CLI.swift 2 (`default:` and
# its `assert(false)` in Options.parse) and Plugin.swift 1 (the
# SecAccessControl failure in generateKey), both a refactor's to remove.
#
# Raised 2026-10-21 by `sherd coverage --record` (root T30): 99.58%,
# 1,174 of 1,179 lines under Sources/, after the macOS 14 port. Every
# new `#available(macOS 26)` fallback runs on this host through the
# `Crypto.isMLKEMAvailable` seam, so no row and no cap changed; the same
# 5 lines stay unrun.
exclude Sources/Crypto.swift:CryptoKitCrypto.newSecureEnclaveP256PrivateKey(dataRepresentation:) needs a real Secure Enclave
exclude Sources/Crypto.swift:CryptoKitCrypto.newSecureEnclaveP256PrivateKey(accessControl:) needs a real Secure Enclave
exclude Sources/Crypto.swift:CryptoKitCrypto.newSecureEnclaveMLKEM768PrivateKey(dataRepresentation:) needs a real Secure Enclave
exclude Sources/Crypto.swift:CryptoKitCrypto.newSecureEnclaveMLKEM768PrivateKey(accessControl:) needs a real Secure Enclave
excluded 22
lines 99.58
